# bucket_dispense, the WITH-LAVA capture (lane z=4), kept as evidence.
# Lava is measured here and NOT pinned in conformance: minecraft:lava has no
# behaviour in mc-tick, so a build holding one refuses at load by name. The
# rule generalises to it exactly — see the z=4 lines below.
